<title>SWITZERLAND: MOTORCYCLING-1997 WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP CALENDAR.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-1997 WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP CALENDAR.</headline>
<dateline>LAUSANNE, Switzerland 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997 world</p>
<p>championship calendar announced by the International</p>
<p>Motorcycling Federation on Monday (125, 250 and 500cc classes):</p>
<p>April 13 Malaysia (Shah Alam)</p>
<p>April 20 Japan (Suzuka)</p>
<p>May 4 Spain (Jerez de la Frontera)</p>
<p>May 18 Italy (Mugello)</p>
<p>June 1 Austria (Zeltweg)</p>
<p>June 15 France (Le Castellet)</p>
<p>June 28 Netherlands (Assen)</p>
<p>July 6 San Marino (Imola)</p>
<p>July 20 Germany (Nuerburgring)</p>
<p>August 3 to be confirmed (China, Argentina or Brazil)</p>
<p>August 17 Britain (Donington Park)</p>
<p>August 31 Czech Republic (Brno)</p>
<p>September 14 Catalunya (Barcelona)</p>
<p>September 28 Indonesia (Sentul)</p>
<p>October 12 Australia (Phillip Island)</p>
</text>
